Game plan revised

GUI: 1st priority
Title screen is needed, game length will decide if we would need a continue function

HUD, looking for a minimalistic type displaying ammo count, health, direction, key items, weapons

Controls should be clunky and kind of slow, to make it harder to react to threats quickly

MAP: 2nd priority
Only need 1 map to get this project off the ground
Map choice would include the aforementioned locations, the graveyard, the forest, the mansion, lastly the catacombs. Leaning to graveyard

WEAPONS: 3rd priority
Shotgun as a starter weapon, hold four shots, deals 120 damage with damage fall off, loads singles and can cancel reload after any shell goes in.

Revolver with 6 shots, deals 80 damage each shot, loads one at a time unless empty, if empty loads with a speed loader to full.

NPC: 4th priority
Need at least 3 different kinds of enemies
Most likely Zombie, Ghost, Demon

Need a different style of pathfinding for each NPC

Zombie would be straight towards the pc

Ghost would avoid the players view while approaching, preferring their backside whenever possible

Demon can teleport around, most typically after taking damage

INTERACTIVE ELEMENTS: least important
Need pickups for health, ammo, and key items

A door or gate of some kind

Enemy spawners
